<li>Workshop wonten Graphik Center Frans Maseriel ing &lt;a href="Kasterlee"&gt;Kasterlee&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="B%C3%A8lgi"&gt;Bèlgi&lt;/a&gt; (1977)</li>
