Sedaya wewengkon ing &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; Yakushima kalebet ing salebeting wewengkon administrasi kutha &lt;a href="Yakushima%2C%20Kagoshima"&gt;Yakushima&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Distrik%20Kumage%2C%20Kagoshima"&gt;Distrik Kumage&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prefektur%20Kagoshima"&gt;Prefektur Kagoshima&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Yakushima"&gt;Papan Anggegana Yakushima&lt;/a&gt; nglayani penerbangan &lt;a href="Japan%20Air%20Commuter"&gt;Japan Air Commuter&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ngubungaken Yakushima kaliyan &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Kagoshima"&gt;Papan Anggegana Kagoshima&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Papan%20Anggegana%20Internasional%20Osaka"&gt;Papan Anggegana Internasional Osaka&lt;/a&gt;.
