<doc id="96224" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=96224" title="Struve Geodetic Arc">
Struve Geodetic Arc

Struve Geodetic Arc utawi dipunsebut minangka Busur Geodetik Struve inggih punika ranté "triangulasi" ingkang mbentang saking &lt;a href="Hammerfest"&gt;Hammerfest&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt; dumugi &lt;a href="Laut%20Hitam"&gt;Laut Hitam&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang nglewati 10 nagara, inggih punika, &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sw%C3%A8dhen"&gt;Swèdhen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Moldova"&gt;Moldova&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Litowen"&gt;Litowen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A8tlan"&gt;Lètlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%89stlan"&gt;Éstlan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt; lan meh sadaya jarakipun langkung saking 2.820&amp;nbsp;km, ingkang ngasilaken pengukuran akurat pisanan saking titik&lt;a href="meridian"&gt;meridian&lt;/a&gt;.
Ranté punika dipundhirikaken lan dipun-ginakaken déning ilmuwan &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; kelairan saking &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Friedrich%20Georg%20Wilhelm%20von%20Struve"&gt;Friedrich Georg Wilhelm von Struve&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1816"&gt;1816&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1855"&gt;1855&lt;/a&gt; kanggé netepaken ukuran ingkang pas lan wujud bumi. Nalika punika, rantéé namung ngléwati kalih nagara: &lt;a href="Uni%20Sw%C3%A8dhen-Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Uni Swèdhen-Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kamaharajan%20Ruslan"&gt;Kamaharajan Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;. Titik kapisanan Struve dumunung ing &lt;a href="Tartu%20Observatorium"&gt;Tartu Observatorium&lt;/a&gt;, ing pundi Struve dipuntindakaken kathah panalitén.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, Ranté Busur Geodetik Struve kadhaptar minangka &lt;a href="Situs%20Warisan%20Donya%20UNESCO"&gt;Situs Warisan Donya UNESCO&lt;/a&gt; minangka ansambel ingkang ngesenaken, ranté kasungsun saking 34 plak péngetan utawi &lt;a href="tugu"&gt;tugu&lt;/a&gt; "terintegrasi" langkung saking 265 titik ing 10 nagara, papan utama dipunparingi tandha kanthi dipunbolongi ing watu lan wesi salib ingkang dumunung ing inggil tugu.
Pengukuran ranté triangulasi kasungsun saking 258 segitiga utama lan 265 geodetik simpul. Titik paling lèr dunungipun caket ing &lt;a href="Hammerfest"&gt;Hammerfest&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt; lan titik paling kidul caket kaliyan &lt;a href="Laut%20Hitam"&gt;Laut Hitam&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Prasasti"&gt;Prasasti&lt;/a&gt; punika dumunung ing 10 nagara, lan saben monumen kadhaptar minangka &lt;a href="Situs%20Warisan%20Donya%20UNESCO"&gt;Situs Warisan Donya UNESCO&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Lokasi Monumen Busur Geodetik Struve ing saben Nagara</h2>
<h3>&lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fuglenes ing &lt;a href="Hammerfest"&gt;Hammerfest&lt;/a&gt;</li>
